
# Base URL:
# http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/shop



# 01. ONE-TO-ONE ASSOCIATION


### Create Customer
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/shop/Customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ID": 1,
    "name": "Rudra"
}


### Create Customer Profile
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/shop/CustomerProfiles
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ID": 101,
    "phone": "9876543210",
    "city": "Kolkata"
}

### Connect Customer 1 to Profile 101

PATCH http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/shop/Customers(1)
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "profile_ID": 101
}


### Get Customer
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/shop/Customers(1)


### Get Customer Profile
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/shop/CustomerProfiles(101)


### Expand Profile
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/shop/Customers(1)?$expand=profile

###
PATCH http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/shop/CustomerProfiles(101)
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customer_ID": 1
}

###
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/shop/CustomerProfiles(101)?$expand=customer



